eezeacpu_03_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_03_22","text":"Sorry if I'm stressing anyone out.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_03_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_03_23","text":"It's okay, really.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_03_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_03_24","text":"Anyway,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_03_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_03_25","text":"since we're all here chatting,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_03_26","text":"has anyone seen anything fun or interesting?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_03_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_03_27","text":"Anything fun?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_03_28","text":"Hmm...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_03_29","text":"The people over here are dressed up as ghouls, and they look so real.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_03_30","text":"They're scaring all the younger children away.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"neon","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_03_31","text":"Lol","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"anis","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_03_32","text":"Hilarious.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"quiry","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_freezeacpu_03_33","text":"Other than that though,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_freezeacpu_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"quir